# New York | Oaxaca

A trip itinerary is prose that Jot understands. A line with a weekday, month
and day starts a day; a line starting with a clock time is a stop; indented
`Key: value` lines under a stop are its details. Format Document tidies the
times and indentation. Hover a stop, open the outline, fold a day, or run
`jot agenda --week` while traveling.

